WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:06.176
It was a quiet morning at Ray's Diner.

2
00:00:06.177 --> 00:00:11.213
Flo was helping Randy in the kitchen while Ally was refilling saltshakers.

3
00:00:11.214 --> 00:00:14.552
But she wasn't doing a very good job.

4
00:00:14.553 --> 00:00:20.122
"Oh no." Ally moaned.

5
00:00:20.123 --> 00:00:23.289
"This is the third time I overfilled a shaker!"

6
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:25.810
She began cleaning up the mess.

7
00:00:25.811 --> 00:00:28.885
"I have to keep my mind on my work and stop thinking about—"

8
00:00:28.886 --> 00:00:31.980
Mateo burst into the diner. "Hey, Ally!"

9
00:00:31.981 --> 00:00:36.499
"Ahh!" Ally was so startled, she spilled even more salt!

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.157
"Oops, sorry to scare you," Mateo said.

11
00:00:40.158 --> 00:00:42.963
"I'm just really excited! Aren't you?"

12
00:00:42.964 --> 00:00:48.237
Ally sighed. "What is there to be excited about?"

13
00:00:48.238 --> 00:00:51.927
"The lunar eclipse on Saturday night! Remember?

14
00:00:51.928 --> 00:00:54.461
I sent you that article about it."

15
00:00:54.462 --> 00:00:59.499
"Oh, right." Ally shrugged and went back to cleaning up the salt.

16
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:03.233
"I thought you'd be excited to see the lunar eclipse and . . ."

17
00:01:03.234 --> 00:01:07.981
Mateo trailed off, peering closely at her.

18
00:01:07.982 --> 00:01:13.448
"Oh. It reminds you of home, is that it?"

19
00:01:13.449 --> 00:01:17.501
"No, we don't even have a moon," Ally said.

20
00:01:17.502 --> 00:01:22.069
"Then what's wrong? You don't seem like yourself," Mateo said.

21
00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:24.897
Ally looked at Mateo in confusion.

22
00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:28.075
"If I'm not myself, who would I be?" "It's

23
00:01:28.076 --> 00:01:31.738
just an expression," Mateo said. "It

24
00:01:31.739 --> 00:01:35.035
means you're not acting like you usually do." "Oh!"

25
00:01:35.036 --> 00:01:38.645
Ally blurted out what was bothering her. "I

26
00:01:38.646 --> 00:01:43.145
was so happy when Julius asked me to go to the movies with him. But

27
00:01:43.146 --> 00:01:46.186
I haven't heard from him since that night. I

28
00:01:46.187 --> 00:01:50.014
guess he changed his mind about our date." "That's

29
00:01:50.015 --> 00:01:52.994
weird," Mateo said. "Because

30
00:01:52.995 --> 00:02:00.301
when I saw him two days ago, he said he was really looking forward to going on a date with you. Maybe

31
00:02:00.302 --> 00:02:02.947
he got cold feet." Flo

32
00:02:02.948 --> 00:02:08.850
came into the dining room. "Who has cold feet?" she asked. "Julius

33
00:02:08.851 --> 00:02:11.516
does," Ally said. "Mateo

34
00:02:11.517 --> 00:02:15.465
says that's why he hasn't called me to set up a date yet. But

35
00:02:15.466 --> 00:02:20.698
I don't know what the temperature of his feet has to do with anything." Flo

36
00:02:20.699 --> 00:02:26.857
laughed. "He's probably just nervous, Ally. Maybe

37
00:02:26.858 --> 00:02:31.794
he thinks you changed your mind about the date. Hey!

38
00:02:31.795 --> 00:02:37.996
I have an idea! What if you go on a double date with Mateo and Bethany? That

39
00:02:37.997 --> 00:02:42.810
way neither of you will feel a lot of pressure. What do you think?" Ally

40
00:02:42.811 --> 00:02:48.456
frowned. "A double date? How about a single date first?" "A

41
00:02:48.457 --> 00:02:54.437
double date means two couples go out together," Mateo said. "Silly

42
00:02:54.438 --> 00:02:57.799
me!" Ally giggled. "That's

43
00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:03.363
a great idea, Flo. That should make all our feet nice and warm!" Ally

44
00:03:03.364 --> 00:03:07.234
was beginning to feel better when Barry ran into the diner. "Have

45
00:03:07.235 --> 00:03:14.061
you heard of the TV show Food Truck Rally ?" he asked breathlessly.

46
00:03:14.062 --> 00:03:16.327
"Sure," Mateo said.

47
00:03:16.328 --> 00:03:19.883
"I haven't," Ally said. "What is it?"

48
00:03:19.884 --> 00:03:23.711
"It's a reality show with food trucks," Barry said.

49
00:03:23.712 --> 00:03:28.516
"The idea is that six food trucks compete in a one-day cook-off around a theme.

50
00:03:28.517 --> 00:03:33.620
The winning truck gets five thousand dollars!"

51
00:03:33.621 --> 00:03:36.373
"It sounds fun," Ally said.

52
00:03:36.374 --> 00:03:38.755
Barry nodded. "Well, guess what.

53
00:03:38.756 --> 00:03:43.118
They picked Sandville as the location for a new episode.

54
00:03:43.119 --> 00:03:49.318
The theme is Out of This World, and they want Rolling Ray's to compete!"

55
00:03:49.319 --> 00:03:53.101
"Papi is going to be thrilled!" Mateo said.

56
00:03:53.102 --> 00:03:55.410
Barry nodded. "I hope so."

57
00:03:55.411 --> 00:03:58.575
Just then Mateo's phone rang.

58
00:03:58.576 --> 00:04:02.588
"It's my dad. We'll find out right now what he thinks."

59
00:04:02.589 --> 00:04:05.176
He started a video call with Ray.

60
00:04:05.177 --> 00:04:08.599
"Hey, Papi. We have some exciting news!"

61
00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:11.940
"I do too!" Ray said. "You go first."

62
00:04:11.941 --> 00:04:14.399
Barry leaned in toward Mateo's phone. "Rolling

63
00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:19.646
Ray's has been invited to compete on the next episode of Food Truck Rally ."

64
00:04:19.647 --> 00:04:24.023
"The prize is five thousand dollars," Mateo said.

65
00:04:24.024 --> 00:04:28.667
Ray looked upset. "Gosh, kids, I'm sorry, I can't do it.

66
00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:32.954
I finally planned a vacation for myself—a fishing trip with my high school buddies.

67
00:04:32.955 --> 00:04:37.560
I leave tomorrow. Mateo, your mom will come and stay with you and Ally while I'm gone."

68
00:04:37.561 --> 00:04:42.570
Mateo sighed. "Well, you deserve a vacation, Papi.

69
00:04:42.571 --> 00:04:45.465
I guess we have to turn the TV show down."

70
00:04:45.466 --> 00:04:49.309
Barry looked upset.

71
00:04:49.310 --> 00:04:53.535
"Maybe we don't have to say no," Ally said.

72
00:04:53.536 --> 00:04:57.976
"Barry has been running the food truck all by himself and doing a great job.

73
00:04:57.977 --> 00:05:01.348
Mateo, you and I can help him with the cook-off."

74
00:05:01.349 --> 00:05:03.520
"Yeah!" Mateo nodded.

75
00:05:03.521 --> 00:05:06.970
"Bethany and Kate can probably help too."

76
00:05:06.971 --> 00:05:09.467
"An all-kid team!" Barry said.

77
00:05:09.468 --> 00:05:14.335
"The show loves teams with a gimmick. And so do the fans."

78
00:05:14.336 --> 00:05:20.878
"Great!" Ray smiled. "And if you win, you kids can split the prize."

79
00:05:20.879 --> 00:05:24.497
"Wow," Ally said as Mateo hung up the call.

80
00:05:24.498 --> 00:05:34.652
"We're going to be on TV. I can't wait to be a star!"

